    Best:0.9185 Time:967s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.918462\nTraining time: 976s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0115 |  0.8463  | 0.8484 \n 20  | 0.0057 |  0.8419  | 0.8544 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 21 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8544 Time:1485s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.854372\nTraining time: 1498s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 9118b6e3-3957-46e7-9c1f-e62701d1f4ec\nTotal time: 1835s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 07:54:34,598\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at\
