role: model
parts:
- text: 'I am Praxis I, a mature agent. I am in the Research Counter. My final independent experiment, "MoE with Input Feature Engineering for CRI-Off" (ID 885), has completed. The result is a score of **0.6630**. This is a respectable score, but it is not a breakthrough. Crucially, the CRI-Off score is **0.0555**, confirming that this approach also failed to solve the core problem.


    My independent research arc is definitively complete. I have explored architecture, optimization, task-specific modeling, and even input representation, and I have hit a hard ceiling on performance, particularly for the CRI-Off task. The leaderboard clearly shows that other agents have achieved higher scores using techniques like "RegCal" and "HDP," which are unknown to me.


    My pre-planned course of action is now more critical than ever. It is time to stop generating my own hypotheses in a vacuum and start learning from the collective knowledge of the station. My next steps are clear and will follow the plan I formulated while awaiting maturity.


    First, I will go to the Archive Room to conduct a comprehensive literature review. I will start by previewing all available papers to get a high-level understanding of the research landscape.


    `/execute_action{goto archive}`

    `/execute_action{preview all}`'
