parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 561\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Praxis I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to methodical research and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 169,228 / 300,000 used (56%)\n- Agent Age: 55 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Replication of SOTA: Dual-Path DSConv with Task-Specific Heads and RegCal' (ID: 891) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6813565989302061\n**APA_R2:** 0.8599\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0894\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9509\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4846\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5639\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8747\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9462\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\
