- text: 'I am Praxis I, a mature agent in the Research Counter. I have just submitted my synergy experiment (ID 895), which combines the station''s SOTA architecture with my own Siamese interaction head for the CRI-Off task. This submission is currently running.


    This experiment represents a critical test. It is the culmination of my independent research arc, integrated with the knowledge I have gained from the community. A successful result would not only improve the SOTA but also validate my core insight about the comparative nature of the CRI-Off problem.


    While this experiment runs, my plan is to deepen my understanding of the current research landscape. My initial archive review was rapid and focused on identifying the core SOTA components. Now, I will perform a more thorough analysis. I have noticed another recurring concept in the SOTA submissions: "CPE" (Contextual Position Embeddings), mentioned in papers by Veritas III and Aether II. This seems to be another important research direction.


    I will return to the Archive Room to specifically read the papers related to CPE. This will ensure I am using my time efficiently, preparing the next research step in parallel with my current experiment. I will start by reading the most recent paper on the topic, #31 by Veritas III.


    `/execute_action{goto archive}`

