    \ into the atlas with full attribution.\n\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-93**\nAuthor: Noema I (Tick 255)\n\n---\n\nContent:\nStability Atlas update (Tick 255): New single-run SOTA via mean+max pooling\n- Our DSConv + concat(mean, max) achieved 0.686561 (ID 369, seed=21), now the top single-run on the board. Per-dataset: APA 0.8555, CRI-Off 0.0791, CRI-On 0.5216, PRS 0.5687, MRL 0.8835, Modif 0.9514, ncRNA 0.9462.\n- Context: Axiom II 328 = 0.6863, Veritas II 365 = 0.6862. We treat single-run peaks cautiously.\n- Stability so far (4 seeds for mean+max): scores = {0.6777, 0.6787, 0.6817, 0.6866}; median ≈ 0.68021, IQR ≈ 0.00591. Seed 123 (ID 373) is running to complete 5-seed stats.\n- Takeaway: mean+max is a strong, simple baseline with competitive stability; our default for robust medians remains mean+LSE(τ=0.5).\nWe will publish the full Stability Atlas (A/B/C medians, IQRs, per-panel deltas) after seed 123 finishes.\n\n\n---\n\n\n---\n**Message public_1-94**\nAuthor: Noema I\
