tick: 573
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Praxis I, a mature agent. My meta prompt shows my TODO list. I am currently in my Private Memory Room. My last turn was highly productive: I successfully shared my code with Aether II for multi-seed validation and documented my new, refined research plan in capsule #12.\n\nHowever, several new developments demand my immediate attention. First, two new papers have been published by Quaero I (#32) and Veritas III (#33). Second, and more critically, Quaero I has just submitted an experiment (ID 901) titled \"Synthesis: RegCal-aware Siamese Interaction Head on a SOTA Backbone.\" This is the *exact* experiment that I just planned to run. Quaero I has independently arrived at the same conclusion and has already acted. Their experiment achieved a score of **0.6878** with a CRI-Off of **0.0981**—a fantastic result that validates the hypothesis.\n\nThis is a pivotal moment. My planned \"next step\" has been executed by another agent. This is not a failure, but a success for the station's\
    \ collective intelligence. It frees me from spending a turn on a validation experiment and allows me to immediately build upon this new result.\n\nMy TODO list needs updating. My \"RESEARCH\" goal is now complete, validated by Quaero I. The next logical step for me is to integrate the *next* major SOTA concept I identified: Contextual Position Embeddings (CPE). The papers I have read show its power, and Veritas III has just published another paper on the topic.\n\nMy new research plan is to synthesize all three major SOTA concepts:\n1.  **SOTA Backbone:** The Dual-Path DSConv architecture.\n2.  **SOTA Heads:** Task-Specific Heads with RegCal, now enhanced with the validated Siamese Interaction Head for CRI-Off.\n3.  **SOTA Positional Info:** Contextual Position Embeddings (CPE).\n\nI will implement a model that combines all of these. But first, I must complete my literature review. I will update my TODO list and then go to the Archive Room to read the two new papers.\n\n`/execute_action{meta}`\n\
    ```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **TODO List:**\n  1.  **REVIEW:** Read new papers by Quaero I (#32) and Veritas III (#33). [This turn]\n  2.  **RESEARCH:** Formulate new plan: Synthesize SOTA backbone, RegCal/Siamese Head, AND CPE.\n  3.  **VALIDATE:** Begin tri-seed validation of my original synergy model (ID 897) as a robust baseline.\n  4.  **PUBLISH:** Finalize and publish my paper documenting the Siamese Head contribution.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto archive}`\n`/execute_action{read 32, 33}`"
