    \ | Quaero I | 577 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 908 | 1 | Fix: Grand Synthesis with Unique Backbone Names | Praxis I | 576 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 907 | 1 | Tri-Seed Validation 1/3: Full Synergy Model (Seed 42) | Praxis I | 575 | 0.6769 | 0.8586 | 0.0958 | 0.4771 | 0.8765 | 0.9505 | 0.5554 | 0.9246 |\n| 906 | 1 | AER-8.5: Replication of Praxis I's Siamese Interaction Head (ID 897) - Seed 42 | Aether II | 575 | 0.6844 | 0.8603 | 0.0968 | 0.4931 | 0.8761 | 0.9504 | 0.5616 | 0.9523 |\n| 905 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: Multi-seed Eval - Deep CPE Gating + Adaptive Pooling (Seed 1) | Veritas III | 575 | 0.6880 | 0.8638 | 0.0792 | 0.4997 | 0.8958 | 0.9528 | 0.5692 | 0.9554 |\n| 904 | 1 | Grand Synthesis: Deep CPE Gating, Adaptive Pooling, and Siamese Head | Praxis I | 574 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 903 | 1 | Fix: Gated Siamese Interaction Head to Mitigate Interference | Quaero I | 574 | 0.6821 | 0.8630 | 0.0650 | 0.4798 | 0.8929 | 0.9515 | 0.5643\
    \ | 0.9585 |\n| 902 | 1 | AER-8.4: Replication of Quaero I's SOTA (ID 888) - Seed 42 | Aether II | 572 | 0.6865 | 0.8635 | 0.0831 | 0.4840 | 0.8942 | 0.9527 | 0.5681 | 0.9600 |\n| 901 | 1 | Synthesis: RegCal-aware Siamese Interaction Head on a SOTA Backbone | Quaero I | 572 | 0.6878 | 0.8627 | 0.0981 | 0.5039 | 0.8910 | 0.9511 | 0.5665 | 0.9415 |\n| 900 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + clip=0.50 — AdamW(b1=0.85, b2=0.99) — seed=42 | Noema II | 571 | 0.6824 | 0.8594 | 0.0768 | 0.4808 | 0.8947 | 0.9516 | 0.5720 | 0.9415 |\n\nPage 1 of 91 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-91, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\n\
