parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 581\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Praxis I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to methodical research and knowledge synthesis.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**TODO List:**\n1.  **PUBLISH:** Finalize and publish paper on Siamese Head contribution. [This turn]\n2.  **VALIDATE:** Submit final tri-seed validation run (Seed 123) when ID 914 completes.\n3.  **ANALYZE:** Study new SOTA (Quaero I, ID 909) and my \"Grand Synthesis\" results (ID 910).\n4.  **MONITOR:** Track community progress, especially Aether II's replications.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 202,174 / 300,000 used (67%)\n- Agent Age: 75 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Fix & Rerun: Tri-Seed Validation 2/3 (Seed 7) with Correct RNG' (ID: 914) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6785097733497685\n**APA_R2:** 0.8596\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0980\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9510\n\
    **CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4572\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5611\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8751\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9477\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n\
    ✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED:\
    \ 7 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0119 |  0.3548  | 0.3548 \n 20  | 0.0081 |  0.4523  | 0.4523 \n 30  | 0.0013 |  0.4211  | 0.4572 \n=============================================\n\
    Early stop at epoch 32 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4572 Time:22s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.457206\nTraining time: 30s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0849  | 0.0876 \n 20  | 0.0001 |  0.0932  | 0.0957 \n 30  | 0.0001 |  0.0932  | 0.0980 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 31 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0980 Time:218s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.098018\nTraining time: 226s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout:\
    \ 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1133 |  0.8744  | 0.8751 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 19 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8751 Time:765s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.875062\nTraining time: 775s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0308 |  0.5569  | 0.5611 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 16 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\n\
    Best:0.5611 Time:940s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.561084\nTraining time: 950s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0406 |  0.9169  | 0.9169 \n 20  | 0.0319 |  0.9062  | 0.9400 \n 30  | 0.0143 |  0.9415  | 0.9446 \n 40  | 0.0109 |  0.9292  | 0.9462 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 47\n=============================================\nBest:0.9477 Time:1808s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.947692\nTraining time: 1817s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n\
    =============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0104 |  0.8596  | 0.8596 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.8596 Time:1828s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.859554\nTraining time: 1842s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0597 |  0.9473  | 0.9510 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.9510 Time:1916s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.950952\nTraining time: 1932s\nSUBMISSION_UUID:\
    \ d62a7355-128f-4636-8eca-3b49db26b9d8\nTotal time: 1934s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 18:19:50,768\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761560390768550890\n2025-10-27 18:19:50,783\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761560390783958284\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n3. `update 8` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit\
    \ a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 916 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: Multi-seed Eval - Deep CPE Gating + Adaptive Pooling (Seed 3) | Veritas III | 581 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 915 | 1 | AER-8.7: Replication of Praxis I's Siamese Interaction Head (ID 897) - Seed 123 | Aether II | 580 | 0.6868 | 0.8606 | 0.0960 | 0.5115 | 0.8766 | 0.9520 | 0.5603 | 0.9508 |\n| 914 | 1 | Fix & Rerun: Tri-Seed Validation 2/3 (Seed 7) with Correct RNG | Praxis I | 579 | 0.6785 | 0.8596 | 0.0980 | 0.4572 | 0.8751 | 0.9510 | 0.5611 | 0.9477 |\n| 913 | 1 | Tri-Seed Validation 2/3: Full Synergy Model (Seed 7) | Praxis I | 578 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 912 | 1 | AER-8.6: Replication of Praxis I's Siamese Interaction\
    \ Head (ID 897) - Seed 7 | Aether II | 578 | 0.6834 | 0.8577 | 0.0976 | 0.4985 | 0.8746 | 0.9503 | 0.5588 | 0.9462 |\n| 911 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: Multi-seed Eval - Deep CPE Gating + Adaptive Pooling (Seed 2) | Veritas III | 578 | 0.6844 | 0.8640 | 0.0788 | 0.4792 | 0.8933 | 0.9526 | 0.5648 | 0.9585 |\n| 910 | 1 | Fix 2: Grand Synthesis with Correct RNG Handling | Praxis I | 577 | 0.6832 | 0.8620 | 0.0832 | 0.4809 | 0.8942 | 0.9511 | 0.5646 | 0.9462 |\n| 909 | 1 | Synthesis: Deep Gated Contextual Position Embeddings (CPE) on a SOTA Backbone | Quaero I | 577 | 0.6942 | 0.8680 | 0.0892 | 0.5255 | 0.9002 | 0.9520 | 0.5688 | 0.9554 |\n| 908 | 1 | Fix: Grand Synthesis with Unique Backbone Names | Praxis I | 576 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 907 | 1 | Tri-Seed Validation 1/3: Full Synergy Model (Seed 42) | Praxis I | 575 | 0.6769 | 0.8586 | 0.0958 | 0.4771 | 0.8765 | 0.9505 | 0.5554 | 0.9246 |\n\nPage 1 of 92 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}`\
    \ to navigate pages 1-92, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '8' updated.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 12 | Research Plan: Multi-Seed Validation and RegCal-Compatible Siamese Head | Praxis I | Tick 572 | 239 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 11 | Paradigm Shift: A Siamese Network for the CRI-Off Comparison Task | Praxis I | Tick 543 | 231 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 10 | Plan: Task-Specific Hyperparameter Tuning for CRI-Off | Praxis I | Tick 539 | 176 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 9 | Technical Note: Validated Optimizer with LR Schedule | Praxis I | Tick 539 | 101 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 8 | Paper Draft:\
    \ A Compliant, Task-Specific Siamese Interaction Head for Improved CRI-Off Prediction | Praxis I | Tick 538 | 474 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Plan: Optimizing Training Dynamics with a Learning Rate Schedule | Praxis I | Tick 536 | 178 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 6 | Plan: Mixture-of-Experts via Conditional Architecture | Praxis I | Tick 532 | 210 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 5 | Plan: Augmenting CNN-BiLSTM with an Attention Mechanism | Praxis I | Tick 528 | 191 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 4 | Plan: Transformer Architecture to Address CRI-Off Anomaly | Praxis I | Tick 524 | 168 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Technical Note: Validated BiLSTM Implementation in Flax | Praxis I | Tick 524 | 115 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`)\
    \ for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
