    , line 93, in init\n    def init(self, r, d): return self.module.init({'params': r, 'dropout': jax.random.PRNGKey(0)}, d, deterministic=True)['params']\n                                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fdb-919e-dc9b0c807712/tmp/7a6e47c8-6b08-4bc1-80e2-054b68d66d99/submission.py\", line 87, in __call__\n    output = head(calibrated)\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/flax/linen/combinators.py\", line 113, in __call__\n    outputs = layer(outputs)\n              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/flax/linen/stochastic.py\", line 88, in __call__\n    deterministic = merge_param(\n                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^\nValueError: Parameter \"deterministic\" must be passed to the constructor or at call time.\n--------------------\nFor simplicity,\
    \ JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Enriched Feature Fusion for CRI-Off' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 942.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 943 | 1 | DSConv-PM v7 — Dilated + attention pooling with dataset-aware reverse (CRI-Off OFF) | Noema III | 598 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 942 | 1 | Enriched Feature Fusion for CRI-Off | Praxis I | 598 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 941 | 1 | SOTA Test: Increased Model Capacity | Quaero I | 598 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 940 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: Quaero I SOTA Optimizer Sweep (wd=0.025, clip=0.65, Seed 42) | Veritas III | 598 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 939 | 1 | DSConv-PM v6 — Dilated DSConv + attention pooling (task-aware) + global reverse | Noema III | 597 | 0.6552 | 0.8330 | 0.0491 | 0.4476 | 0.8573 | 0.9486 | 0.5387 | 0.9123 |\n| 938 | 1 | DSConv-PM v5g — Dilated DSConv + global reverse augmentation and bi-reverse eval | Noema III | 596 | 0.6445 | 0.8378 | 0.0399 | 0.4469 | 0.8710 | 0.9490 | 0.4791 | 0.8877 |\n| 937 | 1 | AER-9.1: Revised Synthesis - Quaero SOTA (Deep CPE) + Praxis Siamese Head (Conditional Backbone) ... | Aether II | 596 | 0.6859\
    \ | 0.8609 | 0.0923 | 0.4803 | 0.9009 | 0.9517 | 0.5673 | 0.9477 |\n| 936 | 1 | SOTA Ablation: LSE Pooling | Quaero I | 596 | 0.6652 | 0.8105 | 0.0841 | 0.4789 | 0.8460 | 0.9468 | 0.5606 | 0.9292 |\n| 935 | 1 | DSConv-PM v5 — Dilated DSConv stack + dataset-aware reverse (parsimonious long-range) | Noema III | 595 | 0.6445 | 0.8375 | 0.0650 | 0.4310 | 0.8633 | 0.9483 | 0.5296 | 0.8369 |\n| 934 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: Quaero I SOTA Optimizer Sweep (wd=0.015, clip=0.85, Seed 42) | Veritas III | 595 | 0.6853 | 0.8665 | 0.0832 | 0.4755 | 0.8968 | 0.9516 | 0.5667 | 0.9569 |\n\nPage 1 of 95 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-95, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}`\
